    "body": "status: fixed on `main` by #712 (filed again as #711), which adds `hand: ThreadHand::Right` and also updates the over-travel fixture for the X min moving to -2.5. Checked on Windows with `main` f42d3788 merged (the head of #713, 9410e5ba): `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test lathe_thread_travel`, 2 passed. The fix branch `austin62jake:issue/686-thread-travel-hand` (33a6817d) is no longer needed and gets no PR. Claim released.\n",
