    "body": "FYI for the fix here: besides the missing `hand` field, `a_real_over_travel_on_a_lathe_is_still_refused` also has a stale fixture. It rewrites `\"min\": 0.0, \"max\": 320.0` in the built-in Lathe, but #647 changed that band to `\"min\": -2.5`, so once it compiles the test stops on its own \"the X band was rewritten\" check. Found while merging #516.",
